I reach the office.
I have gotten completely wet due to the rain.
I go inside.
Rohan, Priya, and my manager Suresh are in the breakroom.
They see me and smile.
"Happy birthday, Maya!" they all say together.
There is a big chocolate cake on the table.
This is a surprise for me.
I am very happy.
"Rohan, did you bring this cake?" I ask.
Rohan says, "I ordered this cake yesterday."
Priya says, "Yes, the weather outside is very bad."
"But the cake has finally arrived safely."
Suresh gives me a knife.
"Come on Maya, cut the cake," he says.
I cut the cake and give everyone a piece.
We eat the cake and talk about the rain.
My colleagues have now become my friends.
